{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b2d9e2c50e06c35358d3b5bce595d2387ddf72ab0d3248b4b6b3516b093f8ed3", "ja": "（次の公演のセンターは、可憐に決めた。\nまずは本人に、その事を伝えないとだけど……）", "zh": "（下次公演的Center，决定由可怜担任了。\n我得先把这件事告诉她本人才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "c16c3c4c19640f9165c40794457860bdf78a7d21c8fffed955fd5160d7dc226f", "ja": "可憐、それって何ていうアロマ？\nアタシも使ってみたいかも！", "zh": "可怜，那种芳香精油叫什么名字呀？\n我也想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fa631d7edc0ae85a46a2521dcf78aa151b63635880b2c3ed927dbe2bec48df21", "ja": "たしかに、穏やかでとてもいい香りです。\n私にも、ご教授願えますか？", "zh": "那味道确实给人一种心安的感觉，\n可以请你也告诉我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "0f61583953ed8cd08ebb8bd600b82b2306f7f026ac4a49b38349bc40465ddcb2", "ja": "あ、えっと……今日の香りは、\n私が、じ、自分でブレンドしたものだから……。", "zh": "啊，这个……今天的味道，\n是我自、自己调配的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "d80dfc77a9252aaec9dd0899d9e14f7bf033cfb95eae25e0efaa0127ec63d0a2", "ja": "気に入ってくれたなら……\n今度、ふたりの分も持ってくるね……♪", "zh": "你们喜欢的话……\n我下次带来给你们……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "37532e86c466786842eb029808e60b60985a4fb56b279531eeccc5739fd51c9d", "ja": "えっ、ホントに！？　いいの？\nありがとね、可憐！　楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "咦？真的吗！？我们可以收下吗？\n谢谢你，可怜！我好期待喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "388a6e00d46f79ee2cb4ded8c91122de461632202bd3d25fcbb48410c67f5a03", "ja": "よろしいのですか？　その、なにやら物を\nねだってしまったかのようで恐縮ですが……。", "zh": "这样真的好吗？那个，感觉自己\n平白跟你要了东西，真是不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "2ff789487e2eefb68171a63441de708b91af9f785cff9c993e1260d67813908a", "ja": "き、気にしないでください……それより、使った\n感想を聞かせてもらえたら、うれしいな……♪", "zh": "请、请别放在心上……比起这个，你用过后\n如果可以跟我说说感想，我会很开心的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c7774913ecfc80dc814ab2338474b215b629ad128ef1cc2f5d0191a5e2f5e724", "ja": "はい、それはもちろん。\nしっかりと伝えさせていただきます。", "zh": "嗯，这是当然，\n到时我一定会跟你说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1009_p", "source_sha256": "761ccf4f982f6d0f8f7898d13e066d404ba1280175187329cb79d1ede1f402b0", "ja": "おーい、可憐。ちょっといいか？", "zh": "喂～可怜，你有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "4acea265cb42e7963cf54db4db749207e2824822c7bc3183b99392527aaba17d", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}？\n可憐に何か用事？", "zh": "怎么了，{$P$}？\n你找可怜有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1011_p", "source_sha256": "610f61b29f683c26250af5bb1008fadc63251c1bc167b04a700d5261236fcd74", "ja": "みんなで盛り上がってるところに悪いな。\n可憐、話があるんだけど、いいか？", "zh": "不好意思，在你们聊得正开心时打扰了。\n可怜，我有些话想跟你说，方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "732ae0e3b8bfdf9f290d57bdeb2e3a841147f39064af65cbc07073418489a9e6", "ja": "わ、私に……ですか……？", "zh": "跟、跟我……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c151184503e506b0d7942a8b05376fcabae5b4a1e55bf4d95bb39ecf65e9877", "ja": "さては{$P$}も、可憐の\nアロマが欲しいの？　いい匂いだもんね、にゃはは♪", "zh": "难不成{$P$}也想要可怜的\n芳香精油吗？毕竟真的很香呢，呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5a73131290ef2c94709b43d8a29eb5e94741ac3a5bbf8983f0d26e7794579046", "ja": "あなたに香りを楽しむ趣味があったとは驚きです。\nしかしアイドルに物をねだるなど、いささか不躾では？", "zh": "你居然有品香的兴趣，真叫人讶异。\n但你这样跟偶像要东西，不觉得有点失礼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ab20f53d00e2ed51084f30f208c715fcb473f64872e3ed5bed6b94d1c4f4798a", "ja": "い、いや、そうじゃなくて。\n可憐に、次のセンターをお願いしようと思ってな。", "zh": "不、不是啦，你们误会了。\n我是想请可怜担任下次公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "59d478354bf3daf2250e823c00118ad68c99430f4db47e8ff1d94639fa80d5a1", "ja": "えっ……センター、って……？\n私が………………………………。", "zh": "咦……你说Center……？\n由我………………………………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "4ee8bf425857167ff25316d03f24b65c7db25f0a6bfb24b1ede642ce0bc06a3f", "ja": "可憐がセンター！？\nやったじゃん、可憐！　アタシ、超応援するよ！！", "zh": "找可怜当Center！？\n太棒了，可怜！我会大力声援你的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "87100bad93f8c0ca9970f03dfa7e44a7b2969bb67691f75f734fa9c5ff57a359", "ja": "可憐？　……おーい、可憐？\n可憐、可憐ってばー。", "zh": "可怜？\n……喂～可怜？可怜，可怜你在听吗──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6239929be4a822ea706397a9759fd3e37ef9a9dae939527909ead81a69f2ed89", "ja": "篠宮さん……？\n……はっ！　こ、これは！？", "zh": "筿宫……？\n……啊！这、这是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "401ff3e029629e15cffe891fc7dae56d1aef5bb1052ff3fcaf7a6e5d4c9151ea", "ja": "ちょ、{$P$}！\n可憐、立ったまま気絶してない！？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}！\n可怜是不是站着晕过去了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9bd14e34d9f868d12c04a0986f575a48e9483fbc82cba7c8c6cf558041abbfaf", "ja": "え、ええっ！？　目を開けたまま気絶するなんて、\nすごいバランス感覚だ……！", "zh": "什、什么！？居然能睁着眼失去意识，\n平衡感也太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "66a4537a1f7c95d883fae4e89f8fc28dd64557795eb9b630e165d635840cc3ef", "ja": "感心している場合ですか！", "zh": "现在是佩服的时候吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1024_p", "source_sha256": "dcdcc606b7f12d443d4ed38dde0ba541ef8302fcf86f8c8a9f4d5c2e17762647", "ja": "そ、そうだった。……おーい、可憐！\n可憐、戻ってこい、可憐ー！", "zh": "对、对喔……喂～可怜！\n可怜，快回神啊，可怜──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1025_null", "source_sha256": "55b90876703c8d28413505ee7beabff9790ed45d2f932b74febba52194f7dd70", "ja": "ユサユサ……", "zh": "（摇摇）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "136603b91617e97f3a225952fff78d30e77d1c8e5f52d76f9cdb9df6d54822d1", "ja": "はっ！？　……あっ、す、すみません……。\nびっくりしすぎて、一瞬、頭が真っ白に……。", "zh": "啊！？……啊，不、不好意思……\n因为太过震惊，我的脑袋瞬间一片空白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "107a3ec28a43aac3a29abff1aa368506a942c4780d7773080cdad10de5f7c100", "ja": "よかった、気がついて！\nもう、どうなる事かと思ったよ～。", "zh": "太好了，你清醒了！\n真是的，我还以为出了什么大事呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2b1c5b2011edf9800b84346baf650f0f116d23e6503f4619ccc9d98d8d5f1e58", "ja": "ええ……。", "zh": "就是说啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "3a135ae41dce4146c53f4f2680d9e0af640e87c943072011f7ba6a504345251c", "ja": "ご、ごめんね、心配させちゃって……。\nあの、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "对、对不起，让大家担心了……\n那个，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "c5716eda07040180d138c93e9b38ee4217ddd44a19339120de75c6c0e5dbaca9", "ja": "ほ、本当なんですか？\n次の公演、私がセンターって……。", "zh": "你、你是说真的吗？\n下次公演要由我当Center……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1031_p", "source_sha256": "9ee51b287373327686596a1e5ecc872e85455ba047296fe2b49c5e3f9393846a", "ja": "ああ、可憐にやってもらいたい。\n……大丈夫か？", "zh": "是真的，希望你愿意。\n……办得到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "3cc7edb68f91312f86fafb5f2a485d313e0e93fd80c77b2e385a16de33b502e6", "ja": "うぅ……だ、大丈夫かどうかは……。\nが、がんばりたいとは、思います……けど……。", "zh": "呜呜……我、我也不确定自己行不行……\n但、但我会加油……努力的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "c48d86dca321c3a949c842631152618aa748c12875d1051050e2019277d91c0d", "ja": "可憐、大丈夫だって！\n公演まで、一緒に特訓しよ！　ね？", "zh": "可怜，你没问题的！\n在公演之前，我们就一起特训吧！好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "dfca4606782a14b74aa0359cfe5335b24f8264ed133b13389d4e624cf8c9ed5a", "ja": "一緒に……い、いいの……？\n恵美ちゃんに、迷惑がかかっちゃうんじゃ……。", "zh": "一起……可、可以吗……？\n我这样，是不是会给惠美添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1035_020meg", "source_sha256": "a0e6995d5bf2f3cb8cb0dd1d9160ec50098bdd73c3366a53994d091dad7b371f", "ja": "アタシがセンターのときは、可憐が\n助けてくれたじゃん！　今度は、アタシの番だよ♪", "zh": "我当Center的时候，\n可怜也有帮我啊！这次换我来帮你了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "14261764bfc5f3eee10592ac77c85149c0b4c0e34a05230b22304fb5a67208b7", "ja": "篠宮さんの不安な気持ち、わかります。\n私も、たくさんの方に支えていただきました。", "zh": "我明白筿宫心里的不安。\n我那时也是多亏有各位在一旁协助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1037_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ad4f34d6421e26f856244bf00cb2abb04f1e369a3a9c6e54a5cc8fac51ddb1a7", "ja": "微力ながら、お手伝いをさせてください。", "zh": "所以我很乐意略尽棉薄之力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "ee3be695669f589d4aa55e9f5725054187651981461a3ede3686fbffb3ee398e", "ja": "恵美ちゃん、紬さん……。\nあ、あの、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "惠美、䌷……\n那、那个，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1039_045kar", "source_sha256": "d8c50fc0d321a1c9516f77936c43182d9d82efc40a6b9843c406a37924f18916", "ja": "た、頼りない私ですけど……。\nみんなと一緒に、が、がんばりたいので……！", "zh": "我、我明白自己不是很可靠……\n但我想和大家一、一起努力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
