{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_039_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_039_1042_045kar", "source_sha256": "a2d50ff5c587391f2d21f9017ec21b70209ad09cea6bd2149de50f98e5d6b068", "ja": "は、はい……！\nせめて、き、気絶しないようにしなくちゃ……！", "zh": "好、好的……！\n我至少得进、进步到不会晕过去才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
